cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se este software for usado numa publicação, cite-o como abaixo."
type: software
title: "cgekit: a general toolkit for SAM-based computable general equilibrium models in Python"
abstract: >-
  Social accounting matrix handling and balancing, calibration, configurable nests and closures, within-period solution, recursive dynamics, and welfare measurement, with base-year reproduction, homogeneity and Walras checks built in.
authors:
